-- Taiwan deep-dive content (English). A post-issuance transmission model,
-- closer in shape to the Philippines/South Korea "issue-then-report" family
-- than to the clearance-model countries elsewhere in this tracker (Colombia,
-- Argentina, Jordan). eGUI has been mandatory for all business-tax-registered
-- entities (B2B and B2C) since 1 January 2021; the 2024 Business Tax Act
-- amendment layered on 7-day/2-day transmission deadlines and TWD 1,500-15,000
-- penalties; MIG 4.0 became the sole valid format from 1 January 2026. A
-- September 2025 Peppol Authority adoption for cross-border invoicing is
-- explicitly voluntary and is covered here as context, not as a scope change.









